                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1752df84-2dae-40b7-ab5d-2d7e43806f2c",
                        "entry_id": "6fa85260-863f-3509-9b13-d8c6d5c2f622",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "cacodémoniaques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "910ee7df-bf98-36ae-859c-6165a882e515",
                        "entry_id": "6fa85260-863f-3509-9b13-d8c6d5c2f622",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est agité, possédé ou semble possédé par un mauvais démon, un cacodémon."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4503511-5718-40a2-bb4e-6135c21a83af",
                                "sense_id": "910ee7df-bf98-36ae-859c-6165a882e515",
                                "text": "Elle était autrefois de bonne volonté et soumise ; elle se montra de mauvaise humeur, désobéissante et méchante. Le soir du 16 octobre, le caractère cacodémoniaque éclata dans toute son horreur par un rire hideux et glapissant."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d1808ee6-87a1-381d-a75a-5fa9d4083271",
                        "entry_id": "6fa85260-863f-3509-9b13-d8c6d5c2f622",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à un mauvais démon, un cacodémon."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b810379b-131f-412e-a54d-b0af2e8b7618",
                                "sense_id": "d1808ee6-87a1-381d-a75a-5fa9d4083271",
                                "text": "Attirés par le bruit que faisait cette agression cacodémoniaque, le maître et la servante osaient à peine se regarder."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1234a3e-03d8-412c-87ce-b210d8595d40",
                                "sense_id": "d1808ee6-87a1-381d-a75a-5fa9d4083271",
                                "text": "J’ai déjà dit la fureur infernale — cacodémoniaque — avec laquelle la tempête refluait en faisant résonner des milliers de voix enlaidies par toute la hargne accumulée pendant une éternité de solitude."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "03c13bec-1380-4efb-a50f-203496cbb741",
                                "sense_id": "d1808ee6-87a1-381d-a75a-5fa9d4083271",
                                "text": "Mais c’est la créature cacodémoniaque, bien visible au premier plan avec son air concupiscent, qui m’empêcha de détourner le regard de la toile."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0083a0b6-ca94-4f65-87af-fad7f1f22188",
                        "source_entry_id": "6fa85260-863f-3509-9b13-d8c6d5c2f622",
                        "target_lang_word": "cacodemoniac",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cacodemoniac",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1322096-39ca-36e6-aaf7-36e51c488cb3",
                                        "entry_id": "c1fa609e-43ee-3e6b-9ef9-b2ac65051032",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Demonic, evil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f6e6112-ca1d-4a6e-8168-34c9544f9025",
                                                "sense_id": "d1322096-39ca-36e6-aaf7-36e51c488cb3",
                                                "text": "He awoke to find his nostrils being savaged by an odour about a billion times worse than anything he had ever smelled in his life — a cacodemoniac swirl of rubber and garlic and dysentery and murder […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "32da78ec-6273-4a0c-891e-ef3b00be8b89",
                        "source_entry_id": "6fa85260-863f-3509-9b13-d8c6d5c2f622",
                        "target_lang_word": "cacodaemoniacal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cacodaemoniacal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cbedd4cf-3cf9-3e59-a9dd-3ea6445cb969",
                                        "entry_id": "e3209a36-ad2c-3472-9af8-5d3a5753414f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Demonic; evil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52c20ead-b8b0-4af7-9780-59b99c6f1750",
                                                "sense_id": "cbedd4cf-3cf9-3e59-a9dd-3ea6445cb969",
                                                "text": "I have said that the fury of the rushing blast was infernal — cacodaemoniacal — and that its voices were hideous with the pent-up viciousness of desolate eternities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a84a7e86-888d-4510-afd9-26779eb44a3a",
                                                "sense_id": "cbedd4cf-3cf9-3e59-a9dd-3ea6445cb969",
                                                "text": "I fled as a man flies from dream to baleful dream of some cacodemoniacal night."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
